	(text "SHARED DEVICE CONTRACT\nU60 unit 1 = Memory (2 IIN1, 3 VC1, 4 IOUT1).\nU60 unit 2 = Ghost (7 IIN2, 6 VC2, 5 IOUT2).\nU60 unit 4 = wet master (10 IIN4, 11 VC4, 12 IOUT4).\nU60 units 3 and 5 remain on sheet 06; no second SSI2164 is created."
