	)
	(text "WET SUM CONTRACT\nR510 = R511 = 40.2k; R512 = 20.0k.\nEach branch magnitude = 0.4975; two equal full-scale branches ~= 0.995 total.\nVCA controls are bounded and fail-safe-selected on sheet 08; sheet 05 adds isolation/filtering only."
